He says,

460
00:37:34,640 --> 00:37:46,460
It is tempting for many Christians to explain the aspects of reality away, to deny them, or to emphasize only the triumphant aspects of the Christian experience.

461
00:37:47,140 --> 00:37:53,640
But this is an inappropriate posture towards the world because God's world is not yet fully set right.

462
00:37:53,640 --> 00:37:58,460
We must mourn and lament when we face tragedy, pain, and suffering.

463
00:37:58,460 --> 00:38:03,960
It does not glorify God to give its sentimentality by looking for the silver lining in bad situations.

464
00:38:03,960 --> 00:38:06,780
When we suffer, we must grieve.

465
00:38:08,260 --> 00:38:17,360
Not only is that a healthy response, it is an honest and truthful one that resonates with what God knows is true about his world.

466
