470
00:38:52,460 --> 00:39:04,480
And not only this, but even amid suffering, God is working by his Holy Spirit to do good to his people, triumphing in small ways over evil by turning pain into fuel for perseverance on the part of the people of God.

471
00:39:04,480 --> 00:39:12,480
The task of the church, therefore, is to live fully and truthfully into the reality of this world as it is.

472
